      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-9093",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "We have a matrix of the form\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041065/assets/2ebec2a87fd922bcbe30ee648e102188b48854abcad34d88cc18695cac67e1bd.png)\n\nTherefore,  $M_{22}$ must be a $2 \\times 3$ block.",
